        "title_text": "About Us",
        "heading_text": "Our Pickle Story",
        "paragraph_text": "There are some flavors that never leave us.   The aroma of a freshly opened pickle jar at the family dining table. The taste of mango pickle served with hot parathas during summer vacations. The recipes lovingly prepared by mothers and grandmothers that made every meal special.  As life became faster, many of these traditional homemade flavors slowly disappeared from our kitchens. That is why Divya Prabha Foods was born. Our mission is simple: To preserve authentic Indian pickle-making traditions and bring the same homemade taste to families across India.",
        "usp1_icon": "\ud83e\udd6d",
        "usp1_text": "Generational recipes, unchanged since 1980",
        "usp2_icon": "\u2600\ufe0f",
        "usp2_text": "100% Sun-dried in traditional clay Barnis",
        "usp3_icon": "\ud83d\udeab",
        "usp3_text": "Zero preservatives, zero artificial colours",
        "usp4_icon": "\u2764\ufe0f",
        "usp4_text": "Small handcrafted batches, packed with care",
        "quote_text": "Every pickle we make is Baa's love sealed in a jar \u2014 a tradition we refuse to shortcut.",
        "quote_author": "Divya Prabha, Founder",
        "button_text": "Read Our Full Story",
